keys: e stop | m menu | g hand-guide

=== Startup mode ===
  s = run the phase sequence from q_init
  h = hold the q_init pose
  t = hold with the set-up impedance
  g = hand-guide the start pose
  q = go to q_init and inspect
  o = open the hand now
  c = grasp the tool now
  r = recalibrate hand width, fingers empty
  f = fetch the tool from the holder
  b = put the tool back
  e = stop and quit
While a run is going: e+Enter stops, m+Enter comes back here.
